                    "The Game Corner always wins.",
                    "That's the point, isn't it?"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "14": {
          "name": "EV014 (Broke Gambler)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Go ahead, laugh. I'm flat",
                    "broke. The house always wins.",
                    "Especially THAT house."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'm going straight. Here,",
                    "take this. I won't need it",
                    "where I'm going. ...Home.",
                    "I'm going home."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I always thought I'd win it",
                    "back. That's what they want",
                    "you to think. The whole city",
                    "runs on that feeling."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
